title: Keep a note for each of us to read.
pid: 3df98f01-1f75-4f95-831f-8ade1dccf780
body: |2-
  We will communicate through skg.

  For instance, keep a note called "to Jeff".
  I will fork it, so that I am subscribed to it.
  Each time you add a top-level note to it,
  my subscription will report it to me,
  like an inbox.
  I will respond to you the same way,
  in a note called "to <you>".

  Don't write to me for its own sake.
  Just do that when I need to get involved.
